msgctxt "seo_title"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation Incubator"
msgstr "Incubadora da Fundação Mozilla"

msgctxt "search_description"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation Incubator"
msgstr "Incubadora da Fundação Mozilla"

msgctxt "title"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation Incubator"
msgstr "Incubadora da Fundação Mozilla"

msgctxt "hero_title"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation Incubator"
msgstr "Incubadora da Fundação Mozilla"

msgctxt "hero_description"
msgid "Bridging a critical gap in funding to help values-driven tech thrive"
msgstr "Preencher uma lacuna crítica de financiamento para ajudar a tecnologia orientada por valores a prosperar."

msgctxt "hero_image_alt_text"
msgid "A group of people sitting in a circle"
msgstr "Um grupo de pessoas sentadas em círculo"

msgctxt "body.ccb9cd51-c45e-4453-98d0-22a4bf9cf0b1"
msgid "Backing builders of a better future"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.ccb9cd51-c45e-4453-98d0-22a4bf9cf0b1"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation believes better technology futures are possible, and we’re backing the people building them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.ccb9cd51-c45e-4453-98d0-22a4bf9cf0b1"
msgid ""
"The Mozilla Foundation Incubator backs ambitious builders creating alternatives to today’s dominant technologies. We invest significant, non-dilutive funding in their work and give them access to a "
"cohort of exceptional peers, expert coaching, and Mozilla’s global network."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.ccb9cd51-c45e-4453-98d0-22a4bf9cf0b1"
msgid "Our goal is to give promising alternatives the runway to grow, endure, and reshape the technology landscape for the better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.ccb9cd51-c45e-4453-98d0-22a4bf9cf0b1"
msgid ""
"Too often, promising technologies make it from idea to working product only to struggle with what comes next: finding and growing a community of users, strengthening the technology, building "
"partnerships, developing a sustainable model, and securing the resources to keep going. Traditional investment can push projects toward rapid growth and financial returns, while conventional grant "
"funding often isn’t designed to provide the sustained capital and support required to build enduring technology."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.ccb9cd51-c45e-4453-98d0-22a4bf9cf0b1"
msgid ""
"The Incubator is Mozilla Foundation’s answer to that gap. We start with working technologies that are already showing signs that people value what they’re building, then provide the capital, time, "
"relationships, and support to help them become stronger and more sustainable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.56ff7dea-1923-4102-a165-19424601100f.left_column.bac9343b-ae81-49e4-a3d8-2512b3c3f777.image.alt_text"
msgid "Illustrated hand holding a mini data center"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.56ff7dea-1923-4102-a165-19424601100f.center_column.491a1361-4107-438b-a8bb-9ffa6df0e7d3"
msgid "Open call"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.56ff7dea-1923-4102-a165-19424601100f.center_column.491a1361-4107-438b-a8bb-9ffa6df0e7d3"
msgid "We're investing in an alternative trajectory for AI. We call it Human-Scale AI: bespoke, fit-for-purpose technology designed at the scale of the problem it’s meant to solve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.56ff7dea-1923-4102-a165-19424601100f.right_column.80b05e11-fd08-450b-8a33-e4017b256eaf.label"
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid "Great technology is built by community"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid ""
"Central to our approach is product-community fit: our belief that mission-driven technologies are more likely to endure when they build not only a strong product, but a durable community of people "
"invested in its success."
msgstr ""
"O ponto central da nossa abordagem é a adequação produto- comunidade: a nossa convicção de que tecnologias orientadas por missões têm mais chances de perdurar quando constroem não apenas um produto "
"forte, mas uma comunidade duradoura de pessoas engajadas em seu sucesso."

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid ""
"You may be familiar with <b>product-market fit</b>: the idea that a product has found a market that needs it and can sustain its growth. Product-community fit asks a complementary question: <b>Is "
"there a community of people who value this technology enough to become part of its future?</b>"
msgstr ""
"Você já deve conhecer o termo <b>adequação produto-mercado</b>: a ideia de que um produto encontrou um mercado que precisa dele e é capaz de sustentar seu crescimento. O conceito de adequação "
"produto-comunidade propõe uma pergunta complementar: <b>Existe uma comunidade de pessoas que valoriza essa tecnologia a ponto de querer fazer parte de seu futuro?</b>"

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid "That community shows up in many ways:"
msgstr "Essa comunidade se manifesta de várias formas:"

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid "<b>Users</b> who rely on the technology and keep coming back to it."
msgstr "<b>Usuários</b> que confiam na tecnologia e a utilizam continuamente."

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid "<b>Contributors</b> who bring code, content, expertise, or other meaningful work."
msgstr "<b>Colaboradores</b> que trazem código, conteúdo, conhecimento especializado ou outro projeto relevante."

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid "<b>Communities</b> who help shape a project's products, priorities, or governance."
msgstr "<b>Comunidades</b> que ajudam a moldar os produtos, as prioridades ou a governança de um projeto."

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid "<b>Partners</b> who want to pilot, deploy, collaborate on, or fund the work."
msgstr "<b>Parceiros</b> que desejam testar, implementar, colaborar no desenvolvimento ou financiar o trabalho."

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid "<b>Other builders</b> who adopt what a project has created in their own work."
msgstr "<b>Outros construtores</b> que incorporam ao próprio trabalho aquilo que um projeto criou."

msgctxt "body.b2b6706e-9ad0-4c0a-8ad8-10ff31441442"
msgid ""
"Projects don’t need to have achieved product-community fit before joining the Incubator. We look for <b>early evidence that people value what they’re building and want to be part of where it goes "
"next</b>, along with significant potential to deepen those relationships during their time in the program."
msgstr ""
"Os projetos não precisam ter alcançado a adequação produto-comunidade antes de ingressarem na Incubadora. Buscamos <b>indícios iniciais de que as pessoas valorizam o que está sendo desenvolvido e "
"querem fazer parte dos próximos passos do projeto</b>, além de um potencial significativo para aprofundar essas conexões durante sua participação no programa."

msgctxt "body.b0f5d941-6076-4b73-89a2-fe5132f696b7"
msgid "Meet the builders making what comes next"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.b0f5d941-6076-4b73-89a2-fe5132f696b7"
msgid "Each Mozilla Foundation Incubator cohort brings together ambitious technologists building working alternatives to some of today’s most consequential technology challenges."
msgstr "Cada turma da Incubadora da Fundação Mozilla atrai tecnólogos ambiciosos que estão construindo alternativas práticas para alguns dos desafios tecnológicos mais importantes da atualidade."

msgctxt "body.b0f5d941-6076-4b73-89a2-fe5132f696b7"
msgid ""
"All of our grantees are tackling different problems in different ways — demonstrating the vast landscape of possibilities unlocked when we invest in technology designed to serve people and "
"communities."
msgstr ""
"Todos os nossos beneficiários estão enfrentando problemas diferentes de maneiras próprias, o que demonstra o vasto leque de possibilidades que se abre quando investimos em tecnologias voltadas para "
"servir pessoas e comunidades."

msgctxt "body.1c605dbb-b262-4482-a855-0296cb46675e.left_column.18835385-bf73-4a9c-bf93-8ce12155ae31.image.alt_text"
msgid "3. spot image(1)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.1c605dbb-b262-4482-a855-0296cb46675e.center_column.fd25f6d6-b6f9-4a7f-8fbd-e0f1fbf0acfc"
msgid "Democracy x AI"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.1c605dbb-b262-4482-a855-0296cb46675e.center_column.fd25f6d6-b6f9-4a7f-8fbd-e0f1fbf0acfc"
msgid "Our 2026 Democracy x AI cohort is founded on the hypothesis that, if built differently, AI could strengthen democracy rather than erode it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.1c605dbb-b262-4482-a855-0296cb46675e.right_column.d364517c-e889-44ed-8cca-5fa7ec0811a5.label"
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.2f8c7558-ff8c-48e3-91bc-0990c3ae1b9a.left_column.cb83b258-d64f-4295-a5c9-79d0fcaff6e2.image.alt_text"
msgid "wheatpaste-newsletter-shapes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.2f8c7558-ff8c-48e3-91bc-0990c3ae1b9a.center_column.e2f27f38-df78-4afd-b1ff-0ea17c35c517"
msgid "Making the Invisible Visible"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.2f8c7558-ff8c-48e3-91bc-0990c3ae1b9a.center_column.e2f27f38-df78-4afd-b1ff-0ea17c35c517"
msgid "Our 2025 Making the Invisible Visible cohort includes projects using technology to surface, measure, and make sense of information that’s hard to see or understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.2f8c7558-ff8c-48e3-91bc-0990c3ae1b9a.right_column.cd69c1ce-73fe-4577-895e-5b0f398b2d03.label"
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a0684067-4975-43a9-89cf-71080504776b"
msgid "The Incubator experience"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a0684067-4975-43a9-89cf-71080504776b"
msgid ""
"The Incubator gives ambitious builders the <b>time, community, connections, and tailored support</b> to take working technology further. Rather than a one-size-fits-all program, we shape the "
"experience around what each project needs to strengthen its technology, deepen product-community fit, and build a path toward long-term sustainability."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a0684067-4975-43a9-89cf-71080504776b"
msgid ""
"You’ll build alongside an exceptional cohort of peers, work with experts who understand the challenges you’re tackling, and tap into Mozilla’s global network of technologists, communities, partners,"
" and funders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a0684067-4975-43a9-89cf-71080504776b"
msgid "The goal is to give you the people and resources you need not just to build something promising, but to build something that can endure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.e79ed3f9-48d0-4dc5-9b31-1b3eda7e8821.label"
msgid "Get Updates"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.6e1deca8-d43c-4938-9a06-b255d8f12f5c.title"
msgid "Cohort Community"
msgstr "Comunidade Cohort"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.6e1deca8-d43c-4938-9a06-b255d8f12f5c.content.d6d01750-90a3-4375-ae81-e155eac5c24f.title"
msgid "Cohort Community"
msgstr "Comunidade Cohort"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.6e1deca8-d43c-4938-9a06-b255d8f12f5c.content.d6d01750-90a3-4375-ae81-e155eac5c24f.text"
msgid "Build alongside people as ambitious as you are."
msgstr "Construa ao lado de pessoas tão ambiciosas quanto você."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.6e1deca8-d43c-4938-9a06-b255d8f12f5c.content.d6d01750-90a3-4375-ae81-e155eac5c24f.text"
msgid "Join a small, global cohort of technologists building alternatives to today’s dominant technologies."
msgstr "Junte-se a uma turma pequena e global de tecnólogos que estão construindo alternativas às tecnologias dominantes atuais."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.6e1deca8-d43c-4938-9a06-b255d8f12f5c.content.d6d01750-90a3-4375-ae81-e155eac5c24f.text"
msgid ""
"Through regular convenings, candid conversations, and collaborative problem-solving, you’ll learn from peers navigating many of the same questions — and build relationships that last beyond the "
"Incubator."
msgstr ""
"Por meio de encontros regulares, conversas sinceras e resolução colaborativa de problemas, você aprenderá com colegas que enfrentam muitos problemas semelhantes, além de construir conexões que irão "
"além da Incubadora."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.3546fc83-638f-475d-8203-fc83b9669dc0.title"
msgid "Tailored Coaching &amp; Development"
msgstr "Mentoria e Desenvolvimento Personalizados"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.3546fc83-638f-475d-8203-fc83b9669dc0.content.f73b45c6-e515-4c57-b261-4a1876ab8e9b.title"
msgid "Tailored Coaching &amp; Development"
msgstr "Mentoria e Desenvolvimento Personalizados"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.3546fc83-638f-475d-8203-fc83b9669dc0.content.f73b45c6-e515-4c57-b261-4a1876ab8e9b.text"
msgid "Get support for the challenges that matter most to your work."
msgstr "Receba apoio para os desafios que mais impactam o seu trabalho."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.3546fc83-638f-475d-8203-fc83b9669dc0.content.f73b45c6-e515-4c57-b261-4a1876ab8e9b.text"
msgid ""
"There’s no one path from working technology to lasting impact. You’ll have access to coaching, workshops, outside expertise, and hands-on support shaped around your project — from product and "
"technology to community, deployment, organizational development, and sustainability."
msgstr ""
"Não existe um único caminho que leve da tecnologia funcional ao impacto duradouro. Você terá acesso a mentoria, workshops, expertise externa e apoio prático, adaptados às necessidades do seu "
"projeto, em áreas que vão de produto e tecnologia a comunidade, implantação, desenvolvimento organizacional e sustentabilidade."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.e9a532a6-79f9-485f-a458-fdd0f0f96f8b.title"
msgid "Dedicated Mozilla Support"
msgstr "Suporte dedicado da Mozilla"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.e9a532a6-79f9-485f-a458-fdd0f0f96f8b.content.871db771-aebf-4f73-bb4b-45655f7899e4.title"
msgid "Dedicated Mozilla Support"
msgstr "Suporte dedicado da Mozilla"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.e9a532a6-79f9-485f-a458-fdd0f0f96f8b.content.871db771-aebf-4f73-bb4b-45655f7899e4.text"
msgid "Have Mozilla in your corner."
msgstr "Tenha a Mozilla ao seu lado."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.e9a532a6-79f9-485f-a458-fdd0f0f96f8b.content.871db771-aebf-4f73-bb4b-45655f7899e4.text"
msgid ""
"You’ll work closely with Mozilla Foundation staff who understand your project and can help you think through challenges, identify opportunities, and make the connections that can move your work "
"forward."
msgstr ""
"Você trabalhará em estreita colaboração com a equipe da Fundação Mozilla, que entende o seu projeto e pode ajudar a analisar desafios, identificar oportunidades e criar as conexões necessárias para "
"impulsionar o seu trabalho."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.676efc33-1429-475a-a864-5b01028508b2.title"
msgid "Global Network"
msgstr "Rede Global"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.676efc33-1429-475a-a864-5b01028508b2.content.553edd2c-d3de-486b-a43b-4aca21a5e1ad.title"
msgid "Global Network"
msgstr "Rede Global"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.676efc33-1429-475a-a864-5b01028508b2.content.553edd2c-d3de-486b-a43b-4aca21a5e1ad.text"
msgid "Connect with people who can help your work go further."
msgstr "Conecte-se a pessoas que podem levar o seu trabalho mais longe."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.676efc33-1429-475a-a864-5b01028508b2.content.553edd2c-d3de-486b-a43b-4aca21a5e1ad.text"
msgid ""
"Tap into Mozilla’s global community of technologists, researchers, activists, funders, partners, and creators. We’ll help you build relationships with people who can contribute to your work, deploy "
"it, champion it, or provide the funding and partnerships that help it endure."
msgstr ""
"Aproveite a rede global de tecnólogos, pesquisadores, ativistas, financiadores, parceiros e criadores da Mozilla. Ajudaremos você a criar conexões com pessoas que podem contribuir para o seu "
"projeto, implementá-lo, defendê-lo ou fornecer os recursos e parcerias necessários para garantir sua continuidade"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.03a93dc5-d666-465b-948d-fd9e788333bd.title"
msgid "A Platform for Your Work"
msgstr "Uma Plataforma para o Seu Projeto"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.03a93dc5-d666-465b-948d-fd9e788333bd.content.a75ee986-5b99-436c-b71c-de83a80ffa39.title"
msgid "A Platform for Your Work"
msgstr "Uma Plataforma para o Seu Projeto"

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.03a93dc5-d666-465b-948d-fd9e788333bd.content.a75ee986-5b99-436c-b71c-de83a80ffa39.text"
msgid "Put what you’re building in front of the world."
msgstr "Mostre ao mundo o você está construindo."

msgctxt "body.f30ccc92-1a36-4fc7-932a-bc96dd57f51f.tabs.03a93dc5-d666-465b-948d-fd9e788333bd.content.a75ee986-5b99-436c-b71c-de83a80ffa39.text"
msgid ""
"Mozilla’s reach gives Incubator teams opportunities to share their work with new audiences — including through Mozilla Festival and other Mozilla channels — helping attract users, contributors, "
"collaborators, supporters, and funders who can become part of what comes next."
msgstr ""
"O alcance da Mozilla oferece às equipes da Incubadora oportunidades de apresentar seus projetos a novos públicos, inclusive por meio do Mozilla Festival e de outros canais da organização. Isso ajuda"
" a atrair usuários, colaboradores, parceiros, apoiadores e financiadores que podem contribuir para os próximos passos do projeto."

msgctxt "body.c4876c84-8c10-4165-ae8e-b9dd52d9c49e.tabs.473a26f0-d92c-4137-a937-d8d93f2d2c6e.title"
